msgid ""
"data/hyperspace.xml.append$//powerEffect[@name=\"og_midnight_main_power\"]/tooltip"
msgstr ""
"[COOLDOWN:N/A]\n"
"\t\t\t\tDeploys an almost indestructible hacking device in the current room, which will repeatedly hack the current room for the rest of the fight.\n"
"\t\t\t\tOn use teleports Operative back to their home ship if possible.\n"
"\t\t\t\tCannot target weapons, drones, or shields.\n"
"\t\t\t\tHack lasts 10 seconds.\n"
"\t\t\t\tDrone Hack cooldown takes 20 seconds."

